{
  "id": "1KI.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Sugoodiga 1",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdeeda was sugoocheanda gheata gwearguumeadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean abeeda Dawdeeda was sugoocheanda niwaasiit nea eara gweanyeakaaschi ea nisaang'ayiit, nea eara iisiikwealsa hang'weaka ea mwanyasa shang'shang'anda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, “Danung' ghwanyagaan huda suumng'eega jea gwandeawa ng'utamiida was sugoocheandeanyu ak gayghoah weajoocheandaanyi, danung' gawiilsageaw daghataanyi, ak ghwanyas ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda shang'shang'anda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geegasa huda miy aba jeeda moonghooda sean bea Israeli, hean ghwadaah Abishagiheeda was huda eemeeda Shunami, ng'ata gweadu heeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea huda aamiy muuchi; hean ghoah siichea gagadiiyeesa sugoocheanda ak gamineadaysa; nea abeeda ea mwanala geat sea sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Adoniya gagasa hawunda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Adoniya orjeeda Hagiti goodiing'u geaw ak gwayi, “Gaydoaw sugoocheanda”; ak gwasissa geaw mutukwajeega ea fuga faraasajeega, ea fih haradam ea damanamughuush jea gwasalda goosheedeawa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghwaan eara aba gilinyoo ea damwan gil miighoanyareas aba giibearsiinda gideaba, “Ng'asheesu gisini aba naaha?” Nea abeeda niny ea siida miy muuchi; nea ghabwat badayda Absalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabalool niny ea Yoabu was orjeeda Seruya ea Abiyatari was ashoohoocheanda; ng'ata ghwaat geeshta Adoniya ak ghaweat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda, ea Benaya was orjeeda Yehoyada, ea Natani was sibaneeda, ea Simeyi, ea Rei, ea furiischoodiga Dawdi ea mandeayi sea Adoniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoniya ghabwar lukghumajeega gisilga, ea gea heewga ea banyeega riisheadi aba murdeeda lagheaneeda ichibooda, mida heeda neekeewa gheang'deenda Rogeli, ng'ata gaguursa orjooga ghwaan, orjooga sugoocheanda, ea fuga hees sean bea Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak hean ea maguursiina Nataneeda was sibaneeda, ghana Benaya ghana furiischoodiga ghana Sulemaneeda was orjeeda ghwaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani geanung' ghoah sugoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Natani gwayeesha Batsheba was gheamata Sulemani, “Mii iinya gideaba Adoniya orjeeda Hagiti niiw sugoocheanda nea Dawdeeda was sugoocheandeanya ea mandeawana iita? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa beeni, deargweakseey, ak abeeda gajaghuuha eaweagaagu ea eaweega orjeedang'u was Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Una heeda Dawdi was sugoocheanda, ak giyeeshi, ‘Neada ea mii ang'iing'i sugoocheandeanyu was Ng'utamiida, iyeaksi habeawooda hudaang'u bea gadiyeeda nea giyeeshi, “Sulemaneeda was orjeedang'u gaygoombaliischi, nea gaygoopteadawa hoorgeedeanyu?” Ak ghamneawa Adoniya sugoocheanda gil aba naaha?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula damanda ibalooli sea sugoocheanda, gaydeadu geashtaang'u dasikteawa ng'asheagaagu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweesa Batsheba sugoocheanda aba jeedeaba gheanyi (nea abeeda sugoocheanda ea niwaasiit muuchi, nea Abishagiheeda was huda eemeeda Shunami gagadiiyeesa sugoocheanda). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batsheba ghwahiiy geaw ak gwasissa mureeda sugoocheanda, ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Ang'iing'i gigasayi naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiideanyu, giyeaksi habeawooda hudaang'u bea gadiyeeda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea giyeeshi, ‘Sulemaneeda was orjeedaang'u gaygoombaliischi, nea gaygoopteadawa hoorgeedeanyu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, ng'ula, Adoniya sugoocheanda gil, nea ang'iing'i Ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda ea mindeawani iita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula nisin lukghumajeega heewga, ea haleanjeeda riisheadi, ea gisilga saang'a, nea niguursa orjooga sugoocheanda, ea Abiyatariheeda was ashoohoocheanda ea Yoabuheeda was shirikarajeanda haw bea lugooda; nea Sulemani was siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ea miyeeguursa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa, Ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, gang'uleey fuga sean bea Israeli, gideaba gayrukusiina saawa siichea goopteadawa hoorgeeda ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda iing'ata niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwahidu, damanda ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda iyadeayi ghweanigaaschi jeeda sigeeda, abeeda aniini ea orjeedeanyu was Sulemani gajeenung' eawoosa fuga adiiy.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula gheata gudu gabaloola sea sugoocheanda, Nataneeda was sibaneeda gawa jeeda ghooriida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Ng'ula nih Nataneeda was sibaneeda gil.” Hean iinea ghwahidu madeeda sugoocheanda ghwahiiy geaw aba madeeda sugoocheanda, ghwahiiy geaw ea ghang'uda gheamamdaanyi ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Natani, “Ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, ang'iing'i nirugu gideaba ‘Adoniya gaygoombaliischi nea gaygoopteadawa hoorgeedeanyu’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula eaweecheanji nirarang'aada, ak gwasin lukghumajeega heewga, ea haleanjeeda riisheadi, ea gisilga saang'a, ak nea ea niguursa orjooga sugoocheanda, Yoabuheeda was shirikarajeanda lugooda, ea Abiyatariheeda was ashoohoocheanda; ak ging'ulayi, gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi aba madeadaanyi, nea gwayeena, ‘Anung' goobiida Adoniyaheeda was sugoocheanda!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba aniini, eawooschi siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ea Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda, ea Benaya was orjeeda Yehoyada, ea siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda was Sulemani, miyeeguursa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa ng'asheanji gweadu ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda nea ea mii rukusiina fugaagu bea gadiyeeda siichea goopteadawa hoorgeeda ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda iing'ata niny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sugoocheanda was Dawdi ghwasha ak gwayeesha, “Aguursiina Batsheba.” Hean ghwahidu heeda mida sugoocheanda ak ghamiinaada aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaak sugoocheanda habeawooda nea gwayi, “Aba gida abiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, lealna gurooroodeanyu jeeda hang'weanidooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideayeaksiindaneegwa habeawooda aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA fuga Israeli nea geayeenyi, ‘Orjeedaang'u was Sulemani gaygoombaliischi, nea gaygoopteadawa hoorgeedeanyu’; ak ghamneawa gaydasin gicha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Batsheba ghwahiiy geaw ea ghang'uda gheamamdaanyi ng'eanyi, ak ghoang'waay geeshanga sugoocheanda, ak gwayi, “Gagasa ghwanyas giibinda ng'utamiideanyu, Dawdeeda was sugoocheanda damanda manda muudeanooda!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda was Dawdi, “Aguursiina Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda, ea Natani was sibaneeda, ea Benayeeda was orjeeda Yehoyada.” Hean ghapka madeeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Ayaada fuga gadiyeeda bea ng'utamiidaang'u, ak gootiing'si orjeedeanyu was Sulemani badayda faraaseedeanyu, ak gooteayeewi ea gwararang'eesa Gihoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda ea Nataneeda was sibaneeda aba hoowa ghamiinda ghoah sugoocheanda ghoahaaghwa Israeli; ak ghoaghuuchi durumbeati, nea gooyeenyi, ‘Gagasa ghwanyas eaweega geawi sugoocheanda was Sulemani!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooyeadu geeshtaanyi, ak gayghoan goopteadawa hoorgeedeanyu; aba gideaba gayghoah sugoocheanda aba hoorgeedeanyu; ak ea naaloachi niny ghoah siichea ghoahaaghwa Israeli ea Yuda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Benayeeda was orjeeda Yehoyada ghwasha ghuuta sugoocheanda, “Amin! Gagasa NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, gwarugu ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji NG'UTAMIIDA, gidaghayi mideayeata sea ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, gagasa gwandeayi sea Sulemani, ak gagasa ghaghaambiit hoorgeadaanyi ea ghang'al dea ng'utamiideanyu, was sugoocheanda siyi Dawdi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda, ea Nataneeda was sibaneeda ea Benayeeda was orjeeda Yehoyada, ea fuga Gereti ea gea Beleti, goodiing'sa Sulemani badayda faraaseeda Dawdeeda was sugoocheanda, ak ghwaat ea ghwahita Gihoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba hoowa Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda gageanu gujaweeda abiita jeeda nagheeda aba jeeda maheemajeanda, ak ghoamwaar Sulemani. Ama ng'ata ghaghuut durumbeati ak gwayi buuneesean, “Gagasa ghwanyas eaweega sugoocheanda was Sulemani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay buuneesean badaydaanyi, ghaghuut furiimbu, nea gahoosan muuchi, hean geeyi bwak ea gwaduumduum ng'eanyiida aba giijuureanda nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoniya ea rabastaanyi sean mideawa ghwayiiy ng'asheesu damanda ahiit agiischooda. Ak gheata iinya Yoabu nyeashta durumbeati, gwayi, “Gaba naaha giijuureanji mida jeeda mujiiniin?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean damanda duu gabalool, ng'ula, ghwahidu Yonatan was orjeeda Abiyasari was ashoohoocheanda; ak gwayeesha Adoniya, “Beeni ghoah, aba gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi siida doabiiwaat nea giyeadu iita ng'asheega miyaas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yonatan ghuuta Adoniya, “Manda, aba gideaba ng'utamiideanya was Dawdi was sugoocheanda ninung' ghoah Sulemani sugoocheanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ea niijeakta sugoocheanda goodeayi sea Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda, ea Nataneeda was sibaneeda, ea Benayeeda was orjeeda Yehoyada, ea fuga eemeeda Gereti ea Beleti; nea ea niidiing'sa uhuuda faraaseeda sugoocheanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda, ea Nataneeda was sibaneeda nimwaar niny ghoah sugoocheanda aba Gihoni; nea ea nidiyeana hoowa aba hooseaneega, hean ghwanung' goojuur mujiini. Hean nih nyeashta iiyiinyi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani niipteadawa hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gicha, ghapka fuga gadiyeeda sugoocheanda ghwadeapta ng'utamiida was Dawdi was sugoocheanda, nea gwayi, ‘ASEATAANG'U gagasa ghoaghaambiit gheawunga Sulemani ea gaburdeawa daang'u, ak gagasa gooheedu hoorgeadaanyi ea ghang'al daang'u.’ Ak gwatkuy sugoocheanda aba uhuuda bulaliidaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean eara sugoocheanda gwayi, ‘Gagasa eakghaambiida NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA Israeli, goonean siyagi aba jeeda jeacheengeasu jea goopteadawa hoorgeedeanyu ghamneawa nea geang'uli gheanyangeasu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata rabasta sean bea Adoniya gwahirbaban, hean ghang'eat ng'eat, ak gaba siisi weah heechea gawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Adoniya ghoawal Sulemani, hean ghang'eat, ak gawa ak ghoang'waay gujaka heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeesha Sulemani, “Ng'ula Adoniya ghoawal sugoocheanda was Sulemani; ng'ula niing'waay gujaka heeda wagiida, nea gwayi, ‘Danung' sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghanyi gweaksean habeawooda gideaba maygwanuus siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda aba ng'uta.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean gwayi Sulemani, “Inyas gayghoahiimu geaw gideaba siida doabiiwaat gil, eara buudeanjagi maygoobisa ng'eanyi; aba mida jeadaanyi munyinda, gayghami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sugoocheanda was Sulemani goojeakta buuneeda ak geerareang'na uhuuda heeda wagiida. Ng'ata ghwahidu ak gwahiiysa geaw sugoocheanda was Sulemani; aba ng'ata gwayeesha Sulemani, “Una gheang'u.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
